    "name": "Wildseed",
    "steam_appid": 3655270,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Wildseed - a relaxing escape where you will plant, nurture, and watch your garden bloom! You start with a small patch of dirt, and grow it into a thriving and diverse home for many different plants and creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/73732f3b3f234d730091caba4705b262.poster.avif?t=1753025748\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/73732f3b3f234d730091caba4705b262.webm?t=1753025748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/73732f3b3f234d730091caba4705b262.mp4?t=1753025748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate and nurture a variety of plants, from carrots and blueberry bushes to palm trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract a wide range of cute creatures to call your garden home, from mice and deer to whales and lions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find rare creature variants!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what ancient mysteries of your garden holds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your encyclopedia with every creature found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock shallow seas, jungle, ocean, and tundra biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish to fill your ponds and oceans.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/09b56a4247bc2fd019f4f2893d7ca12c.poster.avif?t=1753025748\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/09b56a4247bc2fd019f4f2893d7ca12c.webm?t=1753025748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/09b56a4247bc2fd019f4f2893d7ca12c.mp4?t=1753025748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job will be to keep your creatures happy and your garden healthy. Find what food your creatures love! Keep your garden clear of weeds and your plants free from infestations as you\u00a0customize your own cozy garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/6da9085b65f3890898ceb2118cd3dacd.poster.avif?t=1753025748\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/6da9085b65f3890898ceb2118cd3dacd.webm?t=1753025748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/6da9085b65f3890898ceb2118cd3dacd.mp4?t=1753025748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Wildseed - a relaxing escape where you will plant, nurture, and watch your garden bloom! You start with a small patch of dirt, and grow it into a thriving and diverse home for many different plants and creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/73732f3b3f234d730091caba4705b262.poster.avif?t=1753025748\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/73732f3b3f234d730091caba4705b262.webm?t=1753025748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/73732f3b3f234d730091caba4705b262.mp4?t=1753025748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate and nurture a variety of plants, from carrots and blueberry bushes to palm trees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract a wide range of cute creatures to call your garden home, from mice and deer to whales and lions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find rare creature variants!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what ancient mysteries of your garden holds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your encyclopedia with every creature found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock shallow seas, jungle, ocean, and tundra biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish to fill your ponds and oceans.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/09b56a4247bc2fd019f4f2893d7ca12c.poster.avif?t=1753025748\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/09b56a4247bc2fd019f4f2893d7ca12c.webm?t=1753025748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/09b56a4247bc2fd019f4f2893d7ca12c.mp4?t=1753025748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job will be to keep your creatures happy and your garden healthy. Find what food your creatures love! Keep your garden clear of weeds and your plants free from infestations as you\u00a0customize your own cozy garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/6da9085b65f3890898ceb2118cd3dacd.poster.avif?t=1753025748\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/6da9085b65f3890898ceb2118cd3dacd.webm?t=1753025748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655270/extras/6da9085b65f3890898ceb2118cd3dacd.mp4?t=1753025748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
